menu "Passport BSP"

    config BSP_SLEEP_PROFILE
        bool "Dump PM locks and esp_timer statistics 60 s after screen off"
        default n
        help
            Debug aid for the screen-off light sleep measurement: one minute after the screen
            turns off, print esp_pm_dump_locks() and esp_timer_dump() to the console. Enable it
            through sdkconfig.profiling (which also turns on CONFIG_PM_PROFILING and
            CONFIG_ESP_TIMER_PROFILING); release builds leave it off.

endmenu
